# Optional. You almost certainly do not need this file.
#
# The Gemini key is normally entered in the app itself (Settings → Gemini API
# key) and stored in IndexedDB on your device, so nothing has to be configured
# on the server at all.
#
# Set GEMINI_API_KEY only if you want the deployment to carry its own key. It
# then takes precedence over whatever anyone types in Settings — which also
# means anyone who can reach the deployment can spend that key's quota.
#
# It is read from Vercel's project environment in production, and from
# `.env.local` at the REPOSITORY ROOT under `vercel dev` — not from this
# directory. This file is a reminder of the variable name, nothing more.

# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
